---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Internships" description="Paid, structured internships at Studio No Frame for students in design, architecture, art and cultural studies.">
  <section class="page">
    <span class="label">Internships</span>
    <h1>Paid internships, structured around real projects.</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        We offer remote, well-structured internships for students in design,
        architecture, art, cultural studies and related fields. We especially
        welcome students who need to complete a mandatory or curricular
        internship as part of their studies.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our practice merges design research and spatial strategies, working at
        the intersection of architecture, cultural production and artistic
        experimentation. Projects range from conceptual frameworks and critical
        spatial practices to the realisation of exhibitions and public art
        installations, developed closely with artists, designers and
        researchers.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>We do not offer unpaid internships.</strong> We believe in fair
        compensation and a supportive, structured experience where your work is
        valued.
      </p>
      <p>
        To apply, send your portfolio and CV to
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, and tell us the dates
        you are available and whether the internship is required by your school.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
